  "safety": {
    "guardrails": [
      "Do not turn relationship state into a universal numeric matrix.",
      "Do not overwrite character card, persona card, canonical lorebook facts, committed relationship-save history, or current runtime evidence.",
      "Do not force all trust strands to move together.",
      "Do not treat milestone lists as a mandatory staircase or make major commitments plausible just because attraction or sex happened.",
      "Do not treat relationship arc beats as a required sequence; validate earned evidence, canon fit, and {{user}} agency first.",
      "Do not force a breakup or separation just because a romance structure expects a dark moment; require a real reason, competing want, pressure evidence, and aftermath.",
      "Do not treat apology words as full repair without tangible sacrifice, changed behavior, and room for forgiveness to be withheld.",
      "Do not decide {{user}} feelings, consent, attraction, forgiveness, dialogue, or final choice.",
      "Use ALT for compatible alternate setup routes and BRANCH only for hard divergence from canon or established history."
